---
description: Prisma only in infrastructure; no client types in domain/application/presentation
globs: src/modules/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# Prisma boundary

- Import `@prisma/client` only under `infrastructure/`
- Domain/application/presentation use domain interfaces and DTOs only
- Map DB rows via `row-mappers/` before leaving repository
- Soft-delete: filter `deletedAt: null` on reads; set `deletedAt` on delete
- Columns: snake_case via `@map`; tables via `@@map`
